                  <paragraph/>
                  <paragraph>Iced Coffee</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Diisostearyl malate, polybutene, hydrogenated polyisobutene, butyloctyl salicylate, microcrystalline wax, silica dimethyl silylate, caprylic/capric triglyceride, bis-diglyceryl polyacyladipate-2, sorbitan olivate, isononyl isononanoate, polyhydroxystearic acid, rosa canina seed oil, ricinus communis (castor) seed oil, sodium hyaluronate, hydrogenated castor oil, mangifera indica (mango) seed butter, simmondsia chinensis (jojoba) seed oil, hyaluronic acid, sorbitan isostearate, vp/hexadecene copolymer, isostearic acid, lecithin, polyglyceryl-3 polyricinoleate, dehydroacetic acid, tocopherol, iron oxides (ci 77491, ci 77492, ci 77499)</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260303"/>
            </section>
         </component>
